#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:1
msgid "llvm-addr2line - a drop-in replacement for addr2line"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:8
msgid "{program}`llvm-addr2line` \\[*options*\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:12
msgid ""
"{program}`llvm-addr2line` is an alias for the {manpage}`llvm-symbolizer(1)` "
"tool with different defaults. The goal is to make it a drop-in replacement "
"for GNU's {program}`addr2line`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:16
msgid "Here are some of those differences:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:18
msgid ""
"`llvm-addr2line` interprets all addresses as hexadecimal and ignores an "
"optional `0x` prefix, whereas `llvm-symbolizer` attempts to determine the "
"base from the literal's prefix and defaults to decimal if there is no prefix."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:22
msgid ""
"`llvm-addr2line` defaults not to print function names. Use `-f` to enable "
"that."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:24
msgid ""
"`llvm-addr2line` defaults not to demangle function names. Use `-C` to switch "
"the demangling on."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:26
msgid ""
"`llvm-addr2line` defaults not to print inlined frames. Use `-i` to show "
"inlined frames for a source code location in an inlined function."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:28
msgid "`llvm-addr2line` uses `--output-style=GNU` by default."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:29
msgid ""
"`llvm-addr2line` parses options from the environment variable "
"`LLVM_ADDR2LINE_OPTS` instead of from `LLVM_SYMBOLIZER_OPTS`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:31
msgid ""
"`llvm-addr2line` accepts an address with a '+' prefix, e.g. `+0x00777fff`. "
"This is treated as a symbol name by `llvm-symbolizer`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:34
msgid "SEE ALSO"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-addr2line.md:36
msgid "{manpage}`llvm-symbolizer(1)`"
msgstr ""
